      602.48,
      297.78,
      711.55
    ],
    "text": "All that allotment of land described as following name and extent depicted in the Advance Tracing No. Maha/HRS/2022/131 and dated 30.07.2022, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Wegiriya, in Wegiriya Grama Niladhari Division No. 421, in Kulugammana Siyapattuwa Minor Division, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Harispattuwa in Kandy District, Central Province and bounded as follows:",
